- Local-only for demo: In this sample, the data only lives in memory—extend with a backend POST/PUT (Django REST or similar) to save real user answers.
- Easy to add “Add New Memory” by pushing to the array and re-rendering.
- Edit later? Just re-load and update the answers. No retraining needed!

